+"""
+HIL Certification Closure
+ - Run HIL campaigns, run Apalache, collect counterexamples, retry up to N attempts.
+ - Produce signed HIL certification bundle and optionally upload to certifier endpoint.
+
+Usage:
+  python3 hil_cert_closure.py --scenarios-file ops/.../scenarios.txt --golden /opt/aegis/golden_trace.ndjson --out /tmp/hil_closure --cosign kms://... --cert-upload https://certifier/upload
